 injects the"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"m as a dynamic system prompt context section. The context is re-read on each request, so new memorie"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"s take effect immediately."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Skill catalog"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Skills from `~/.claude/skills/` are discovered and their names and descriptions are injected as a ca"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"talog in the system prompt."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Global instructions"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The content of `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` is injected as an early system prompt section (order 5), so glo"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"bal instructions and model routing rules are preserved."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Related bridge plugins"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- dsh-plugin-codex-bridge -- Bridge OpenAI Codex\n- dsh-plugin-opencode-bridge -- Bridge OpenCode\n- d"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"sh-plugin-pi-bridge -- Bridge Pi Agent\n- awesome-dsh-bridges -- Curated list of all bridge plugins"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"MIT -- YYTbit"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
